%%%%** Section 1
\section{USB Overview}
%%%%** Section 1.1
\subsection{Goals}
\begin{itemize}
        \item Ease of Use (for consumer)
        \item Low cost
        \item up to 12Mb/sec
        \item support real-time data / multimedia
        \item flexibility for different devices/needs
        \item Compatible with laptop \& desktop
        \item Highly standardized for easy adoption
        by industry
\end{itemize}

<s>\end{slide}
<s>\begin{slide}
%%%%** Section 1.2
\subsection{Applications}
(as anticipated in 1996)

{\bf Low Speed: 1.5 Mbit/s} Keyboard, mouse, stylus, game peripherals.

{\bf Full Speed: 12Mbit/s} Phone/Audio.

{\bf NOT: } High Speed: Video, Disk Drive

